## Recommendation

**If LIRA-GO:**
1. Schedule cold-review pass on `prompt_lira.py` before any cutover
2. Update `src/prompts/primary_analyzer_prompt.py` to call LIRA system prompt
3. Update production `_parse_response` to use the LIRA schema_adapter pattern
4. Run 60-fixture canary again as PASS-gate
5. Roll-restart fleet during weekend window post-Monday challenge
6. Monitor first 5 trades — same SPRT discipline as detector_version cutover

**If LIRA-STAY:**
1. Document why DP4-extension (+0.486R) didn't replicate at 12-slice scale
2. Investigate methodological differences between mini-backtest + full slice
3. Keep V3 as production prompt
4. Re-investigate or shelve LIRA architecture per CEO direction

**If LIRA-HALT:**
1. CEO + council review the partial signal
2. Consider extended observation in shadow mode (LIRA emits + log + don't
   route trades) for 2-4 weeks before any cutover decision
3. Document the ambiguous evidence for future re-evaluation

